msgstr "Kami memakai [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/issues/new/choose) untuk melacak permintaan dan bug.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Citing this package {#citing-this-package}"
msgstr "Mengutip paket ini {#citing-this-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you use this package in your research, use the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file in this project’s repository to cite the appropriate reference(s).\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu memakai paket ini dalam penelitianmu, pakai file [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) di repositori proyek ini untuk mengutip referensi yang sesuai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Acknowledgements {#acknowledgements}"
msgstr "Ucapan terima kasih {#acknowledgements}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package includes an optional sampling strategy within the self-consistent configuration recovery loop that trims determinants based on intermediate diagonalization results. The implementation is based on joint research from the Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, and IBM. If you use this feature in your research, please also use the citation for the paper, which can be found in the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file with citation key `merz2026crossing`. An implementation of the full workflow from that paper is expected to be available on GitHub soon.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini menyertakan strategi sampling opsional di dalam loop self-consistent configuration recovery yang memangkas determinan berdasarkan hasil diagonalisasi perantara. Implementasinya didasarkan pada riset bersama dari Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, dan IBM. Kalau kamu memakai fitur ini dalam penelitianmu, tolong kutip juga makalahnya, yang bisa ditemukan di file [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) dengan citation key `merz2026crossing`. Implementasi alur kerja lengkap dari makalah tersebut diperkirakan segera tersedia di GitHub.\n"

